{"seq":3,"slug":"price-history-validity-guard","title":"历史价反操纵与异常剔除","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/price-history-drop-alert/price-history-data/price-history-validity-guard","wordCount":2271,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"历史价反操纵与异常剔除\">历史价反操纵与异常剔除</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>价格曲线是用户信任的可视化凭证，也是商家可以操纵的攻击面。操纵有两种方向：<strong>抬高再降</strong>——商家在促销前先把标价拉高，随后「降价」回到原价甚至更高，配合划线价制造虚假折扣；<strong>压低再回</strong>——用极低的一次性价格（限时秒杀、清库存、错价）在曲线上留下一个深坑，让「历史最低价」变成一个永远无法复现的数字。两种操纵都让曲线在最关键的功能上失效：用户依据历史低价判断当前是否值得买，而历史低价恰恰是最容易被污染的那个统计量。</p>\n<p>本文处理的是<strong>数据可信性</strong>，前提是快照与口径已经正确（见 <a href=\"price-snapshot-history-build\">价格快照采集与历史曲线</a> 与 <a href=\"effective-price-denomination\">到手价/券后价口径一致</a>）。识别出虚假降价之后如何处置（展示层降权、商家侧管控、用户提示），见 <a href=\"../price-transparency-ops/alert-abuse-price-game\">虚假降价/价格博弈防控</a>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[原始快照] --&gt; B{价格跳变?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| H[正常曲线]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[方向判定]&#10;  C --&gt; D[抬价再降]&#10;  C --&gt; E[一次性深坑]&#10;  C --&gt; F[错价/数据缺陷]&#10;  D --&gt; G[标记为促销前抬价]&#10;  E --&gt; I{可复现?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| J[从低价统计中剔除]&#10;  I --&gt;|是| K[保留为真实低价]&#10;  F --&gt; L[剔除并告警]\">graph TD\n  A[原始快照] --&gt; B{价格跳变?}\n  B --&gt;|否| H[正常曲线]\n  B --&gt;|是| C[方向判定]\n  C --&gt; D[抬价再降]\n  C --&gt; E[一次性深坑]\n  C --&gt; F[错价/数据缺陷]\n  D --&gt; G[标记为促销前抬价]\n  E --&gt; I{可复现?}\n  I --&gt;|否| J[从低价统计中剔除]\n  I --&gt;|是| K[保留为真实低价]\n  F --&gt; L[剔除并告警]</pre><h3 id=\"真实降价-的判定框架\">「真实降价」的判定框架</h3><p>不是所有价格波动都是操纵。判断一段价格变化是否构成对用户有意义的真实降价，需要三个条件同时成立：<strong>幅度足够</strong>（超过品类噪声水平）、<strong>持续足够</strong>（维持超过一个最短时长）、<strong>面向所有用户可得</strong>（不是定向券或个别用户的错价）。三个条件缺一，就应该从「历史低价」统计中排除，但仍然保留在曲线上（曲线要如实反映曾发生过什么，只是不把它当作可复现的低价来宣传）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"异常检测的统计方法\">异常检测的统计方法</h2><h3 id=\"用中位数与-mad-而不是均值与标准差\">用中位数与 MAD 而不是均值与标准差</h3><p>价格序列的分布是重尾的——一次深坑就足以把均值和标准差拉偏，使得后续用 Z 分数做的检测完全失效。稳健的方法是改用中位数与中位数绝对偏差（MAD）。NIST/SEMATECH 工程统计手册给出的修正 Z 分数正是基于这两者：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.6745</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_i = \\frac{0.6745\\,(x_i - \\tilde{x})}{\\mathrm{MAD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">MAD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0.6745</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>~</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tilde{x}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.35em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">~</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是中位数。手册引用 Iglewicz 与 Hoaglin 的建议，将 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>M</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>3.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|M_i| &gt; 3.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.5</span></span></span></span></span> 的观测标记为潜在异常点（见 <a href=\"https://www.itl.nist.gov/div898/handbook/eda/section3/eda35h.htm\">NIST/SEMATECH e-Handbook 7.1.6</a>）。手册同时给出两条重要的方法论提醒：异常检测方法假设数据近似正态，非正态数据会被误判；以及单异常点检验不应顺序反复使用，因为会分别产生<strong>遮蔽（masking）<strong>与</strong>淹没（swamping）</strong>——前者是异常点互相掩护导致都检不出，后者是把正常点误判为异常。这两点直接解释了为什么价格异常检测必须是「批量、多异常点、稳健」的方法，而不是逐个点做 Grubbs 检验。</p>\n<h3 id=\"为什么-mad-在价格场景特别有效\">为什么 MAD 在价格场景特别有效</h3><p>价格在绝大多数时间里是不变的，这带来一个有利性质：MAD 在大量重复值存在时会取到 0 或极小值，从而对任何真实变动极其敏感。需要处理的是 MAD=0 的退化情形——此时应回退到一个业务上有意义的最小变动单位（如该品类的最小价格刻度）作为分母，而不是直接判定全部异常。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;&#10;def robust_flags(prices, min_scale):&#10;    x = np.asarray(prices, dtype=float)&#10;    med = np.median(x)&#10;    mad = np.median(np.abs(x - med))&#10;    scale = mad * 1.4826&#10;    if scale &lt; min_scale:&#10;        scale = min_scale          # MAD 退化为 0 时回退到品类最小刻度&#10;    return 0.6745 * (x - med) / scale\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> robust_flags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(prices, min_scale):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.asarray(prices, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    med </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.median(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mad </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.median(np.abs(x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mad </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1.4826</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_scale:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> min_scale          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># MAD 退化为 0 时回退到品类最小刻度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.6745</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scale</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>1.4826</code> 是使 MAD 成为正态分布标准差一致估计量的换算常数，与 NIST 公式中的 <code>0.6745</code> 互为倒数：<code>0.6745 / (MAD * 1.4826) = 1 / (MAD * 2.198)</code> 与上式的 <code>0.6745 / scale</code> 等价。两种写法都常见，关键是分母必须是经过一致化换算的尺度，否则 3.5 这个阈值就不再有原来的统计含义。</p>\n<h3 id=\"跳变点的方向与上下文\">跳变点的方向与上下文</h3><p>统计异常只回答「这个点不正常」，不回答「这是不是一次虚假降价」。方向需要靠上下文判断：如果异常点之前存在一段高于历史水平的持续期，那它是<strong>抬价再降</strong>而非真实新低。因此检测必须建立在前一段时间的基线之上，而不是只看单点。实务中用一个滑动基线：以异常点之前 N 天（通常 30 天，与合规的先前价格基准一致）的中位数作为参照，比较「降价后的价格」与这个基线，而不是与「降价前一刻的价格」比较。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反操纵的规则设计\">反操纵的规则设计</h2><h3 id=\"促销前抬价识别\">促销前抬价识别</h3><p>促销前抬价的指纹是：在一段价格平静期后出现一次显著高于基线中位数的抬价，随后回落。识别它需要两条规则组合：抬价幅度超过阈值（如高于 30 天中位数 15% 以上）且持续时间超过若干天（如 3 天以上），之后发生回落。只有持续一定时长的抬价才值得关注，短暂的采集抖动不算。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 识别「抬价再降」：标记每个商品每个渠道的抬价窗口&#10;WITH daily AS (&#10;  SELECT item_id, channel_id, date_trunc(&#39;day&#39;, observed_at) AS d,&#10;         min(amount) AS low, max(amount) AS high, avg(amount) AS avg_p&#10;  FROM price_snapshot&#10;  WHERE kind = &#39;landed&#39;&#10;  GROUP BY item_id, channel_id, d&#10;),&#10;baseline AS (&#10;  SELECT item_id, channel_id, d,&#10;         percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY avg_p)&#10;           OVER (PARTITION BY item_id, channel_id&#10;                 ORDER BY d ROWS BETWEEN 30 PRECEDING AND 1 PRECEDING)&#10;           AS med_30d&#10;  FROM daily&#10;)&#10;SELECT b.item_id, b.channel_id, b.d&#10;FROM baseline b JOIN daily x USING (item_id, channel_id, d)&#10;WHERE b.med_30d IS NOT NULL&#10;  AND x.avg_p &gt; b.med_30d * 1.15&#10;ORDER BY b.d;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 识别「抬价再降」：标记每个商品每个渠道的抬价窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id, channel_id, date_trunc(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'day'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, observed_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> low, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> price_snapshot</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'landed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id, channel_id, d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">baseline </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id, channel_id, d,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_p)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> item_id, channel_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                 ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ROWS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRECEDING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">           AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> med_30d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">item_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">channel_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> baseline b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> daily x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item_id, channel_id, d)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">med_30d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">avg_p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">med_30d</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">d</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这里用 <code>ROWS BETWEEN 30 PRECEDING AND 1 PRECEDING</code> 而不是默认的 <code>RANGE</code> 帧，是为了让每个窗口恰好包含 30 个物理行；默认的 <code>RANGE</code> 帧会把并列的行当作同一位置，在日期重复时让窗口长度不可控（窗口函数的帧语义见 <a href=\"https://www.postgresql.org/docs/current/tutorial-window.html\">PostgreSQL 窗口函数文档</a>）。<code>percentile_cont</code> 而非 <code>avg</code> 作为基线，是上节稳健性要求在这里的延续。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一次性深坑的可复现性判据\">一次性深坑的可复现性判据</h3><p>一个历史低价是否应当被宣传，判据是<strong>可复现性</strong>而非数值本身。可复现性可以从三个维度量化：该价格出现的<strong>时长</strong>（秒杀只有几分钟，正常促销持续数天）、<strong>覆盖面</strong>（多少比例的抽样用户实际能买到）、<strong>是否可再次触发</strong>（价格在随后是否回到同一水平）。只有三者都达标，才把它写进「历史最低价」。否则它仍在曲线上，但被排除在低价统计之外，并可选地在展示层标注为「限时」而不是「历史低价」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>可复现的降价</th>\n<th>不可复现的深坑</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续时长</td>\n<td>数小时至数天</td>\n<td>数分钟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖面</td>\n<td>全部或明确分群用户</td>\n<td>个别用户、错误配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可再次触发</td>\n<td>周期性复现</td>\n<td>一次性、不再出现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与基线关系</td>\n<td>从正常水平平滑下降</td>\n<td>从正常水平断崖跳变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库存状态</td>\n<td>有货可购</td>\n<td>通常显示缺货</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"错价与数据缺陷\">错价与数据缺陷</h3><p>第三类是既非操纵也非促销的价格错误：商家配置失误导致的极端低价、采集器解析错误（把「每 100 克单价」当成总价）、币种识别错误。这类数据的指纹是<strong>与上下文完全不相容</strong>：价格低于品类可能的成本下限、与同商品其他渠道相差数量级、或与币种换算明显矛盾。处理方式是硬性剔除并告警到数据质量看板，而不是交给统计方法——因为它们的偏离程度远超统计阈值，用规则判断比用分布判断更可靠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"剔除之后-保留证据\">剔除之后：保留证据</h2><p>异常剔除必须是<strong>可逆且留痕</strong>的。剔除动作不应删除数据，而应写入标记表，记录剔除原因、规则版本、判定时间与影响的时间区间。这条要求有三个理由：一是规则会演进，历史判定需要重新评估；二是商家申诉时需要给出具体依据；三是效果度量需要知道有多少价格被剔除，以便判断规则是否过于激进。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE price_anomaly_flag (&#10;  item_id      bigint      NOT NULL,&#10;  channel_id   smallint    NOT NULL,&#10;  window_start timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  window_end   timestamptz NOT NULL,&#10;  flag         text        NOT NULL,  -- pre_promo_raise | one_off_dip | data_error&#10;  score        numeric(8,4),&#10;  rule_version text        NOT NULL,&#10;  decided_at   timestamptz NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (item_id, channel_id, window_start, flag)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> price_anomaly_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  item_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  channel_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">smallint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  window_end   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  flag         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- pre_promo_raise | one_off_dip | data_error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  score        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rule_version </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">timestamptz</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (item_id, channel_id, window_start, flag)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"与上游清洗的分工\">与上游清洗的分工</h3><p>需要区分本文的<strong>语义剔除</strong>（价格是真实的，只是不该被当作可复现低价）与采集层的<strong>技术清洗</strong>（数据本身无效：缺失、解析失败、重复投递）。技术清洗属于快照入库前的必经路径（见 <a href=\"price-snapshot-history-build\">价格快照采集与历史曲线</a> 的乱序与缺口部分），异常剔除属于入库后的语义分析层。把两者混在一起会让 <code>price_anomaly_flag</code> 里充满技术噪声，也会让技术问题被误当作商家操纵来处理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>曲线要如实反映发生过的价格，但「历史低价」是有条件的统计量，必须与曲线解耦。</li>\n<li>真实降价需同时满足幅度、持续时长、面向所有用户可得三个条件。</li>\n<li>异常检测用中位数与 MAD 的修正 Z 分数，阈值 3.5，避免均值标准差的非稳健性。</li>\n<li>单点检验顺序反复使用会产生遮蔽与淹没，因此必须做批量、多异常点、稳健的检测。</li>\n<li>判定「抬价再降」要比较降价后价格与 30 天滑动基线，而不是与降价前一刻比较。</li>\n<li>一次性深坑的排除依据是可复现性：时长、覆盖面、能否再次触发。</li>\n<li>剔除必须写标记表留痕、可重评、可申诉，而不是删除数据。</li>\n<li>语义剔除与技术清洗分层，不要混在同一张标记表里。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别出的可疑降价如何转化为运营动作，见 <a href=\"../price-transparency-ops/alert-abuse-price-game\">虚假降价/价格博弈防控</a>；历史低价标识如何声明才不会被这些操纵击穿，见 <a href=\"../price-transparency-ops/lowest-price-badge-display\">历史低价标识与展示规则</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"历史价反操纵与异常剔除","id":"历史价反操纵与异常剔除"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"「真实降价」的判定框架","id":"真实降价-的判定框架"},{"level":2,"text":"异常检测的统计方法","id":"异常检测的统计方法"},{"level":3,"text":"用中位数与 MAD 而不是均值与标准差","id":"用中位数与-mad-而不是均值与标准差"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么 MAD 在价格场景特别有效","id":"为什么-mad-在价格场景特别有效"},{"level":3,"text":"跳变点的方向与上下文","id":"跳变点的方向与上下文"},{"level":2,"text":"反操纵的规则设计","id":"反操纵的规则设计"},{"level":3,"text":"促销前抬价识别","id":"促销前抬价识别"},{"level":3,"text":"一次性深坑的可复现性判据","id":"一次性深坑的可复现性判据"},{"level":3,"text":"错价与数据缺陷","id":"错价与数据缺陷"},{"level":2,"text":"剔除之后：保留证据","id":"剔除之后-保留证据"},{"level":3,"text":"与上游清洗的分工","id":"与上游清洗的分工"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"到手价/券后价口径一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/price-history-drop-alert/price-history-data/effective-price-denomination"},"next":{"title":"收藏/加购降价订阅规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/price-history-drop-alert/drop-alert-subscription/wishlist-cart-alert-rule"}}